 "created": "2026-11-27T00:00:00Z",
 "description": "Anchors only. Each annotation gives the place of one inline note of Svenska Kärnbibeln (the bracketed expansions in its text) among the Hebrew words, computed by software from a word alignment of the Swedish text and not reviewed. The wording of the notes, which is in Swedish, and the Scripture references they contain are not part of this collection; they are to be added when the rights holder has agreed. `source.noteId` names the note: book, chapter, verse and the note's number in the verse."
}
